cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these predictions or code, please cite them as below."
title: "dr4cast: a pre-registered forecast of Gaia DR4 substellar companions"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Akca"
    given-names: "Onuralp"
    alias: "Script-hpp"
version: "v1.0.1"
date-released: 2026-09-25
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Script-hpp/dr4cast"
abstract: >-
  Two ranked lists of Gaia DR3 stars that a machine-learning model expects to receive an orbit solution with a
  substellar companion in Gaia DR4 (below 80 and below 13 Jupiter masses), published with checksums before the release,
  together with the pre-registered manifest, the backtest DR2 to DR3 and the evaluation script.
keywords:
  - Gaia
  - astrometry
  - exoplanets
  - brown dwarfs
  - pre-registration
  - machine learning
